url: https://reblocke.github.io/U-of-U-IM-Codes-and-Rapid-Responses/
abstract: >-
  Learner-facing Quarto course website and teaching materials for the University
  of Utah Internal Medicine residency seminar on leading Code Blue and Rapid
  Response teams. The 2026 interdisciplinary update organizes micro-skill
  modules, scenarios, resources, facilitator notes, and collaboration guidance
  for bedside nurses, nurse-led response teams, and critical care outreach teams.
